  {
    "id": 2009012110010,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "今日、給食でトマトのサラダが出たんですっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040090060",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200901211/2009012110010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009012110020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "まおちゃんはトマトが苦手なので、\r\nあたしの牛乳とこうかんこして──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901211/2009012110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009012110030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしがトマトを食べて\r\nまおちゃんが牛乳を飲んで、乗り切りましたっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901211/2009012110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "取引だな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009012110040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！\r\n牛乳は毎日出るので……っ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901211/2009012110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009012110050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "牛乳を飲んでもらう代わりに、\r\nだれかのきらいなものが出た時は、あたしが食べるんです！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901211/2009012110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどなぁ\r\nでもさ、毎日誰かの嫌いなものがでるわけじゃないだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "誰も嫌いなものがなかった時は\r\nどうするんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009012110060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そういう時は、がんばって飲みます……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901211/2009012110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂はえらいなぁ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009012110070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901211/2009012110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009012110080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あ！　でも、…………────",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901211/2009012110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………果穂？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
