  },
  {
    "id": 2009012110090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あの……\r\nプロデューサーさんにも、理由があるんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200901211/2009012110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん？\r\n理由？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ごめん果穂、詳しく聞かせてほしいんだけど……\r\n話してくれるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "0000"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009012110100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……ぎんなんのにおいは、イチョウが自分を守るためでした\r\n焼きいもは、神社のおそうじをしてもらうため",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "056",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901211/2009012110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009012110110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ドーナツの穴も、梅干しも、\r\n美味しいからじゃなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901211/2009012110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009012110120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えっと、その……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901211/2009012110120"
  },
  {
